  "description": "<p data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"350\">LEGO Harry Potter: The Collection bundelt de complete Harry Potter-avonturen in één game, van jaar 1 tot en met 7. Beleef alle iconische momenten uit de films in de bekende LEGO-stijl, vol humor, puzzels en magie. Speel alleen of samen in co-op en verken Zweinstein en de tovenaarswereld.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"352\" data-end=\"383\">Korte productbeschrijving</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"490\">Een complete LEGO-avonturengame met alle Harry Potter-verhalen, ideaal voor fans van magie en puzzelgames.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"503\">Staat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"577\"><strong data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"522\">In Nette Staat</strong> – Normale gebruikssporen mogelijk, volledig speelbaar.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"594\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"795\">\r\n<li data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"648\">\r\n<p data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"648\">🧙 Volledige Harry Potter-verhalen (jaar 1 t/m 7)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"680\">\r\n<p data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"680\">😂 Humoristische LEGO-stijl</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"717\">\r\n<p data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"717\">🎮 Leuk in singleplayer en co-op</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"749\">\r\n<p data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"749\">🧩 Veel puzzels en geheimen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"795\">\r\n<p data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"795\">👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Geschikt voor alle leeftijden</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"817\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"989\">\r\n<li data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"847\">\r\n<p data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"847\">Platform: Nintendo Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"875\">\r\n<p data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"875\">Genre: Actie / Avontuur</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"911\">\r\n<p data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"911\">Spelmodus: Singleplayer & Co-op</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"931\">\r\n<p data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"931\">Taal: Meertalig</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"957\">\r\n<p data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"957\">Staat: In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"989\">\r\n<p data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"989\">Doosje: Met doosje geleverd</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1009\">📦 Meegeleverd</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1076\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1076\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1076\">LEGO Harry Potter: The Collection (Nintendo Switch) met doosje</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1102\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</h3>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1139\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1139\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</strong></p>",
